# Egress allowlist — one entry per line, `domain [METHODS]`.
#
# Matching is on label boundaries: *.example.com covers a.example.com and
# a.b.example.com, but never example.com itself and never evilexample.com.
# METHODS defaults to GET,HEAD,OPTIONS (safe reads only); use * for all.
#
# This file being present is what makes the allowlist enforcing. Delete it and
# every destination is permitted, with a warning at startup.
#
# Nothing is allowed by default. Add what your agent actually needs:
# api.github.com          GET,POST,PATCH,PUT,DELETE
# uploads.github.com      POST
# github.com              *
# api.anthropic.com       POST
